<title>FINLAND: YIT SAYS RAUTARUUKKI STAKE FALLS.</title>
<headline>YIT SAYS RAUTARUUKKI STAKE FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction group YIT-Yhtyma Oy said in a statement on Thursday that steel group Rautaruukki Oy's stake in it had fallen to 16.8 percent of shares and votes from 20.1 percent before YIT's recent share issue.  </p>
<p>YIT also said insurer Tapiola-Yhtiot's stake fell to 19.7 percent from 23.6 percent.</p>
<p>YIT said the newly issued 4.88 million shares were entered into the trade register on Thursday and became eligible for trade on the Helsinki bourse.</p>
<p>YIT said its share capital rose to 293.03 million markka. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
